    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's department of paediatrics and child health in partnership with Integration Xperts (iX) will develop an artificial intelligence (AI) algorithm on T2*CMR images, the gold standard to gauge cardiac iron overload in thalassaemia patients, a leading cause of morbidity and heart failure.",
